y:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h2 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span><img width=3D"468"  height=3D"146"  src=3D"~tmp{0f85ea71-6a34-4fbc-a759-93f07bfbb302}1838494.files/~tmp{0f85ea71-6a34-4fbc-a759-93f07bfbb302}18384942736.png" ></span><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h2><h2 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(16,32,72);=20mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;" >6.</span></b><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >画布操作区</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h2><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(16,32,72);=20mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >画布操作区包括任务的</font></span></b><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >开发模式画布</font></span></b><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(16,32,72);=20mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >和</font></span></b><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >线上模式画布</font></span></b><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(16,32,72);=20mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >。</font></span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span><img width=3D"468"  height=3D"276"  src=3D"~tmp{0f85ea71-6a34-4fbc-a759-93f07bfbb302}1838494.files/~tmp{0f85ea71-6a34-4fbc-a759-93f07bfbb302}18384942918.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(16,32,72);=20mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >对于离线开发的任务，支持开发模式和线上模式，实现任务代码、调度配置的隔离。开发模式的任务可通过提交上线操作，将任务代码提交到线上模式。</font></span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;=20mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >1.<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >开发模式</font></span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >，对于多节点任务，可将右侧多种类型的节点拖拽入画布中，双击节点，可进入节点弹框，进行相应开发。具体可查看不同节点的开发说明，节点类型介绍。在开发模式下，支持对任务配置</font><font face=3D"宋体" >“资源及配置”、选中运行、查看结果、保存、提交、调度设置、查看修改记录、快速还原等操作。</font></span><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >开发模式相当于任务的测试环境（有些公司叫预发布环境），</font></span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >用户新建任务后，就会进入任务的开发模式。在开发模式下，对任务的节点增减、节点内容修改，以及修改任务的调度配置，都不会影响线上模式的任务。在开发模式下，可执行任务，默认会使用用户的个人账号执行，但也支持平台粒度统一配置为使用项目账号执行。当前仅修改任务负责人和描述会立即生效到线上模式。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;=20mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >2.<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >线上模式</font></span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >，可设置任务的报警信息、查看资源及配置、调度信息、报警信息、嵌套信息等。针对有开启跨环境发布的项目，还支持</font><font face=3D"宋体" >“任务发布”、“添加到发布池”、查看“发布记录”等操作。线上模式相当于任务的稳定版本，在开发模式完成任务的修改、运行等测试工作，提交上线后，就会形成一个线上版本。线上版本的任务节点、节点内容、调度设置等均不支持修改，仅能从开发模式提交上线来完成修改。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;=20mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >3.<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >注意：开发模式和线上模式虽然任务隔离，但是代码相同。所以操作任务时可能会读写相同的数据。本平台支持数据测试功能（数据沙箱），可支持</font>SQL节点一份代码在开发模式和线上模式分别操作离线库和测试库表的功能，详情请见数据测试功能（数据沙箱）。</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><table class=3DMsoNormalTable  border=3D1  cellspacing=3D0  style=3D"border-collapse:collapse;margin-left:2.4000pt;border:none;=20mso-border-left-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;=20mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;mso-padding-alt:0.7500pt 0.7500pt 0.7500pt 0.7500pt ;" ><tr><td valign=3Dcenter  style=3D"padding:3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-left-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;=20border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-top:1.0000pt solid windowtext;=20mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;" ><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"page-break-after:avoid;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >参数名称</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></p></td><td valign=3Dcenter  style=3D"padding:3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt ;border-left:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;=20border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-top:1.0000pt solid windowtext;=20mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;" ><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"page-break-after:avoid;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >说明</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></p></td></tr><tr><td valign=3Dcenter  style=3D"padding:3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-left-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;=20border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-top:none;=20mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;" ><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"page-break-after:avoid;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >任务名称</font></span><span style=3D"font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td><td valign=3Dcenter  style=3D"padding:3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt ;border-left:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;=20border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-top:none;=20mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;" ><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"page-break-after:avoid;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >请输入任务名称，最大长度</font>120个字符</span><span style=3D"font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td></tr><tr><td valign=3Dcenter  style=3D"padding:3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-left-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;=20border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-top:none;=20mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;" ><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"page-break-after:avoid;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >任务类型</font></span><span style=3D"font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td><td valign=3Dcenter  style=3D"padding:3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt ;border-left:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;=20border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-top:none;=20mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;" ><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"page-break-after:avoid;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >1. 多节点任务，表示一个任务中支持拖入多个节点；</span><span style=3D"font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >2. 单节点任务，表示一个任务中仅存在一个特定类型的节点；</span><span style=3D"font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >3. 任务组，在商业化中，不对外开放。</span><span style=3D"font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td></tr><tr><td valign=3Dcenter  style=3D"padding:3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso